  "historyNote": "#4864, eff 7-13-90; amd by #5430, eff 7-1-92; amd by #6052, eff 7-1-95; ss by #7117, eff 10-8-99, EXPIRED: 10-8-07 New. #9553, eff 9-25-09, EXPIRED: 9-25-17 New. #12938, eff 12-9-19",
